         <ab xml:space="preserve">
         <pb n="2b"/><lb n="2b5"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex46042025-05-2812-35-14" status="finalized"> 2 pa <lb n="2b6"/> ni | <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:6418">kha che pan chen</rs> ¦ <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:5552">braM ze <expan>chen po</expan></rs> ¦ <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3892">sa pan</rs> rnaMs ¦ dang por dbang mngon skad 1 ma 1 skyed ¦ der rjes dbang mngon rgyun 'jug pa de srid du dbang mngon skad 1 re dang yid mngon skad 1 re dus mnyaM du skye zhing ¦ yid mngon <expan>skad gcig</expan> phyi ma rnaMs dbang mngon skad 1 snga mas de thag rkyen byas nas skye'i kho rang gi rigs 'dra snga ma las mi skye bas <lb n="2b7"/> yid sngon la rgyun med cing ¦ dbang mngon rnaMs rang gi <expan>rigs</expan> 'dra snga la <note type="gloss">swo</note> las skye bas rgyun dang bcas pa'o ¦ dbang mngon skad 1 2 pa dang yid mngon rdzas 1 la ¦ <expan>de dag</expan> kyang kha phyir ltas la don rig gi 'gros 2 yin la ¦ nang du myong ba'i <expan>ngo bor</expan> thad med pas rang gi 'gros 1 <expan>yin te</expan> 'gros gsuM pa'o ces bzhed ¦</seg></ab>
