         <quote source="work:5564" n="RT IX.8ab"><lg>
            <l xml:space="preserve">spel ma dang ni <pb n="3a"/><lb n="3a1"/> rgyun gyi mtha' ¦</l>
            <l>2 ka la yang gnod byed yod ¦</l></lg></quote>
           <quote source="work:5564" n="RT IX.9"> <lg>
           <l xml:space="preserve">des ‹na› dbang po dbang shes kyi ¦ </l>
            <l xml:space="preserve">rgyu yin yid kyi rkyen du 'gyur ¦ </l>
            <l xml:space="preserve">rang rig yin phyir rgyud gzhan min ¦ </l>
            <l xml:space="preserve">des na <expan>mngon du</expan> 'gros gsuM pa</l>
         </lg></quote>
                  <expan>ces so</expan> ¦</seg>
               </ab>
         <ab xml:space="preserve"><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex046042026-02-1913-52-41" status="finalized">3 pa ni ¦ <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:5551">dz+nya SHri</rs> ¦ <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:6604">nor bzangs</rs> ¦ <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3780"><expan>chos mchog</expan></rs> rnams | yul skad 1 ma 1 nyid kyis yid skad 1 la 1 nyid ces ¦ dbang mngon rgyun 'gad pa'i <lb n="3a2"/> mthar yid mngon skad 1 ma 1 kho na skye bar bzhed ¦ skad 1 ma de yang dus mtha'i yin gyi grub mtha' la <expan>grags</expan> pa dang byar <expan>rdzogs</expan> kyi <expan>ma yin no</expan> |</seg></ab>
         
